      LessonBlock.example("He drinks water in the morning, and his sister waters the plants.", note: "Pehla water noun hai, doosra waters verb hai. Aur and do jumlo ko jor raha hai, conjunction hai."),
      LessonBlock.example("She has not met him since Friday.", note: "Since yahan waqt ke sath rabta jor raha hai. Ye preposition hai."),
      LessonBlock.example("Since the road was closed, we took another way.", note: "Yahan since wajah bata kar do jumlo ko jor raha hai. Ye conjunction hai."),
