      LessonBlock.heading("Ye kahan kaam aata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Rozmarra ki English me tum ye hisse bolte hue istemal to karte ho, lekin pehchanna paper ke kaam ata hai. Paper me is ki teen shaklein ati hain. Kabhi aik jumla de kar kisi lafz ka hissa poochha jata hai. Kabhi chaar jumle de kar poochha jata hai ke kis jumle me ye lafz verb hai. Aur kabhi aik hi lafz ke chaar jumle de kar har dafa ka hissa alag alag pehchanna hota hai. Teeno shaklo ka jawab aik hi hai: kaam dekho, surat nahi."),
