      LessonBlock.heading("Ye kahan kaam aata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Paper me is lesson ke sawal teen rang ke hote hain. Pehla, noun ki qism pehchano. Doosra, collective noun ke sath sahi verb chuno. Teesra, jumle ki ghalti theek karo, jahan aksar a honesty ya golds jaisi ghalti chhupi hoti hai. Teeno ka hal tumhare pas ab hai. Qism pehchanne ke liye sawal poochho: kya ye khaas naam hai, aam naam hai, group hai, ehsaas hai ya jins hai. Verb ke liye sawal poochho: jamaat aik ho kar kaam kar rahi hai ya log alag alag hain."),
