      LessonBlock.paragraph("Pehle jumle me jury collective hai aur unit ke tor par has aur its ke sath aya hai. Doosre jumle me poverty, honesty aur work abstract nouns hain, aur life bhi yahan aik aam khayal ke tor par aya hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Yaad rakhne ki trick"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo trick jo paanch qismo ko hamesha yaad rakhegi. Noun ke paanch bhai samajh lo. Pehla Khaas bhai. Ye hamesha topi pehen kar ata hai, matlab capital letter se. Ye proper noun hai. Doosra Aam bhai. Ye har gali me milta hai, sab par lagta hai. Ye common noun hai. Teesra Jamaat bhai. Ye akela khara dikhta hai, lekin is ke peeche poori team khari hoti hai. Ye collective noun hai. Chautha Jazbaat bhai. Ye nazar nahi ata, bas dil me mehsoos hota hai. Ye abstract noun hai. Panchwan Jins bhai. Ye wo hai jis se baqi cheezein banti hain, sona, loha, lakri. Ye material noun hai. Khaas, Aam, Jamaat, Jazbaat, Jins. Paanch bhai zehen me bitha lo, qismein kabhi nahi bhulo ge. Aur collective wale bhai ke liye aik chhoti si line aur yaad rakho: jamaat aik ho to verb aik, log alag hon to verb bhi alag."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ki aam ghaltiyan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo ghaltiyan dekho jo is lesson se seedhi judi hain."),
      LessonBlock.trap("He showed a great bravery in the battle.", "He showed great bravery in the battle.", "bravery abstract noun hai. Akela abstract noun a ya an nahi leta."),
      LessonBlock.trap("lahore is the capital of Punjab.", "Lahore is the capital of Punjab.", "proper noun hamesha capital letter se shuru hota hai, jumle ke beech me ho ya shuru me."),
      LessonBlock.trap("The jury has given their verdict.", "The jury has given its verdict.", "has singular hai to pronoun bhi singular hoga, its. Has ke sath their milana aadhi singular aadhi plural wali ghalti hai."),
      LessonBlock.trap("She bought two golds from the jeweller.", "She bought gold from the jeweller.", "gold material noun hai. Ye naapa jata hai, gina nahi jata, is liye is ki plural nahi banti."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Poverty are a curse for any nation.", "Poverty is a curse for any nation.", "poverty abstract noun hai aur hamesha singular mana jata hai, is liye is ayega."),
      LessonBlock.trap("The committee meet every Monday in this hall.", "The committee meets every Monday in this hall.", "yahan committee aik unit ke tor par baithi hai jo baqaida meeting karti hai, is liye singular verb meets ayega."),
      LessonBlock.trap("He has a knowledge of many languages.", "He has knowledge of many languages.", "knowledge abstract aur uncountable hai. A knowledge paper me ghalat mana jata hai."),
    ],
